PARITY OF LOGIC (web memos → pure Swift, unit-tested)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
  [x] stats (web `stats`)            — count, Σ kWh, Σ cost_decimal, Σ durationMinutes/n; nil when 0 sessions.
  [x] buildGrid (web `buildGrid`)    — 7×24 buckets by local getDay()/getHours(); Calendar weekday−1
                                       maps to JS 0=Sun…6=Sat; maxCount/favDay/favHour by strict `>`.
  [x] locationData (web memo)        — count by start_place (nil→Unknown), keep ≥2, sort desc, top 10.
  [x] durationMinutes (web helper)   — 0 without end / when end≤start; else round((end−start)/60s).
  [x] convertEnergyFromSI(wh,'kWh')  — Wh/1000 at the display boundary (SI on disk; ADR SI cutover).
  [x] heatColor thresholds           — HeatLevel none/low/medium/high/peak at 0 / <.25 / <.5 / <.75 / ≥.75.
  [x] safe()                         — HeatmapNumeric.safe (finite-or-0) guards every sum/width/label.

