----------------------------------------------------------------------
a11y / adaptive / units
----------------------------------------------------------------------
  · Every heat cell is an a11y element with a spoken summary ("Mon 18:00, 3 sessions, 101.2 kWh");
    populated cells gain .isButton. Each bar gains accessibilityLabel(name)+accessibilityValue(count).
    Stat tiles + favorite combine into single spoken elements; Retry/Refresh labelled.
  · Heat ramp + tints from design tokens (accent/statusSuccess/statusWarning/statusDanger) →
    light/dark/increased-contrast honored via the generated dynamic-color tokens; Reduce-Motion gated
    cell lift + skeleton shimmer.
  · Adaptive: a centered ScrollView (maxWidth 1100) with LazyVGrid(.adaptive) tiles; the 24-hour grid
    scrolls horizontally on compact widths (web overflow-x-auto). iOS 18 + macOS 15 both typecheck.
  · Units: total_energy_added_wh (SI Wh) → kWh only at the projection/display boundary; nothing non-SI
    is stored or computed (frontend SI-cutover discipline).

